  <name>omux</name>
  <summary>Run many Claude Code and Codex sessions side by side</summary>
  <description>
    <p>
      omux groups agent sessions into projects in a sidebar. Each session keeps
      its conversation across relaunches and shows whether its agent is
      working, needs you or is done.
    </p>
    <p>
      This is the Linux version of omux for macOS by Onur Özcan.
    </p>
    <ul>
      <li>Allow or deny tool permissions from the sidebar</li>
      <li>Subagents and their transcripts</li>
      <li>Worktree sessions with pull request status</li>
      <li>Files, Changes and Browser panels per session</li>
    </ul>
  </description>
